---
title: "What belongs on the area versus the album?"
accTitle: "Area card versus album dashboard"
accDescr: "body.md shows one compact album card. eat.md shows the status dashboard, the to-try list, and grouped records. Bases stay an explore view."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 14
    nodeSpacing: 16
    wrappingWidth: 260
---
flowchart TB
  subgraph AREA["body.md area"]
    direction TB
    N["`**Notebooks**<br/>legacy notes`"]
    C["`**Albums card**<br/>104 places · 11 to try`"]
    K["`**Tasks**<br/>the working set`"]
    N --> C --> K
  end
  subgraph ALBUM["eat.md album"]
    direction TB
    D["`**Dashboard callout**<br/>counts and last note`"]
    TRY["`**To try**<br/>11 actionable rows`"]
    LIKE["`**Liked**<br/>grouped wikilinks`"]
    BASE["`**Explore Base**<br/>optional embed`"]
    D --> TRY --> LIKE --> BASE
  end
  C ==>|"open the collection"| D
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  classDef muted fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1F2937
  class C,D,TRY focus
  class N,K muted
  class LIKE,BASE outcome
  style AREA fill:none,stroke:#3B78C2
  style ALBUM fill:none,stroke:#2E7D4F
